Symlinks into the agents' user-level config dirs, so they can be edited from this workspace.
Contents are gitignored (absolute, machine-specific paths) - recreate locally:

  mkdir -p global/claude global/cursor ~/.cursor/skills ~/.cursor/rules

  ln -s ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md global/claude/CLAUDE.md
  ln -s ~/.claude/skills    global/claude/skills
  ln -s ~/.cursor/skills    global/cursor/skills
  ln -s ~/.cursor/rules     global/cursor/rules

Cursor paths come from the managed block in ~/.cursor/.gitignore: skills/ is
"user's personal skills", rules/ is "user-level cursor rules". skills-cursor/ is
Cursor's own built-in set and is deliberately not mapped.
